// Stormglass Commons 52-second cinematic observer show.
//
// This source owns six sealed, reduced-motion presentation beats over the
// admitted MV-V7 observer tableau. Beats 2-4 cite only V4 RUN village
// evidence. Beat 5 is an explicitly separate MV-P10 PHYSICS FIXTURE replay.
// The exhibit forbids any inference that the fixture caused the V4 receipts.
// The browser is read-only and the first executable cut is intentionally silent.

composition "Stormglass Cinematic Observer Show" {
  metadata {
    schema: "hololand.model-village.cinematic-observer-show.v1"
    assetId: "mv-stormglass-cinematic-observer-show-v1"
    title: "Stormglass Commons: Proof in the Light"
