    causalSource: "v4_run_living_commons_projection"
    eyebrow: "BEAT 03 / THE HEARTH"
    title: "The Hearth Answers"
    presenterCopy: "One admitted action is visible as hearthlight because the V4 RUN receipt says it was accepted. The presenter adds no action and writes no receipt."
    audioDescription: "The frame centers the tall amber hearth column and its circular light while the six mantles hold a sealed cloth pose."
