    causalSource: "mv_p10_independent_physics_fixture"
    eyebrow: "BEAT 05 / INDEPENDENT FIXTURE"
    title: "A Separate Gravity Witness"
    presenterCopy: "Now—and only now—the exhibit replays the sealed MV-P10 gravity-token fixture at its settled step 599. It did not cause the cistern, hearth, or boundary receipts."
